{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disappeared Demo is a test version with 30-40 minutes of game play of our full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a horror game, in a semi-open world, based on exploration and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your wife disappears in the middle of a camp. You need to understand what is happening, and find a way to save her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNEXPLAINED EVENTS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo covers the first day-night cycle and firsts anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Semi-open world, you are free to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange and mysterious day and night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variable climates and environments: rain, storms, fog, and several other supernatural climate changes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/extras/events.gif?t=1746049092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A RICH STORY DRIVES THE EVENTS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will be introduced to some of the facts pertinent to the events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A balanced story, without too much verbosity (long texts).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will not be 'led by hand' and will have to read between the lines to understand the game's lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/extras/exploration.gif?t=1746049092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>EXPLORE AND INVESTIGATE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The firsts clues will make you progress in solving the mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find passages of history that will gradually help you understand the plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find various objects, each one with its role in the game's progression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/extras/investigate.gif?t=1746049092\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>TENSION AND ENEMIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be in a classic horror environment, full of psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies are powerful. Avoiding them is the best way to proceed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are limited ways to face enemies, but the necessary resources are scarce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/extras/enemy.gif?t=1746049092\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695590?t=1746049092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695590?t=1746049092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/f6380a8b62515be71106d82170f8c068c61be417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746049092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/f6380a8b62515be71106d82170f8c068c61be417/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746049092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Being a horror game, Disappeared exposes dark environments, which can generate tension and nervousness. There may be chases by enemies that represent supernatural entities."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disappeared Demo is a test version with 30-40 minutes of game play of our full game.</p><p class