><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/extras/investigate.gif?t=1746049092\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>TENSION AND ENEMIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be in a classic horror environment, full of psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies are powerful. Avoiding them is the best way to proceed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are limited ways to face enemies, but the necessary resources are scarce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/extras/enemy.gif?t=1746049092\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Deborah Vellozo da Silva"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3471850","name":"Disappeared"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695590/d6e831547f8600c2fdaac54694842ca28c46a95e/header.jpg?t=1746049092","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133636,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133636/movie480.mp4?t=1746048843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133636/movie_max.mp4?t=1746048843"},"name":"trailer_ingles_2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133636/ad7c3a16ef797239515e889236e335580cf98d75/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746048843","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133636/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746048843","max":"http